<% const hasSpeed=Number(speedSummary.total_count)>0;const peak=[...speedDaily].filter(r=>r.max_speed!==null&&Number(r.total_count)>0).sort((a,b)=>Number(b.max_speed)-Number(a.max_speed))[0]; %>
<section class="unit-showcase" id="unit-showcase" data-unit-showcase>
 <script type="application/json" data-unit-model><%- JSON.stringify({unit:speedFilters.unit,movingAverage:hasSpeed?speedSummary.moving_average:null,maxSpeed:hasSpeed?speedSummary.max_speed:null,average:hasSpeed?speedSummary.average:null,from:speedFilters.from,to:speedFilters.to,peakDate:peak?.work_date||null}).replace(/</g,'\\u003c') %></script>
 <header><div><h3><%= speedFilters.unit %> · visual unit</h3><p>Animasi jalan tambang berdasarkan rekap pada periode pilihan.</p></div><button class="subtle-button" type="button" data-unit-preview>Lihat DT lebih dekat</button></header>
 <div class="unit-showcase-body"><div class="unit-showcase-stage"><canvas tabindex="0" role="img" aria-label="Dump truck <%= speedFilters.unit %>. Klik untuk preview, geser untuk memutar, scroll untuk zoom."></canvas><span class="unit-model-identity"><%= speedFilters.unit %></span><p class="unit-model-error" hidden>Model 3D belum dapat ditampilkan. Angka rekap tetap tersedia di samping.</p><div class="unit-view-controls" role="group" aria-label="Tampilan DT"><button type="button" class="subtle-button" data-unit-zoom="out" aria-label="Perkecil DT">−</button><button type="button" class="subtle-button" data-unit-zoom="in" aria-label="Perbesar DT">+</button><button type="button" class="subtle-button" data-unit-reset>Reset</button><button type="button" class="subtle-button" data-unit-fullscreen>Layar penuh</button></div></div>
 <aside class="unit-performance"><span>TOP SPEED <%= speedFilters.unit %></span><strong data-unit-top-speed><%= hasSpeed?speedNumber(speedSummary.max_speed):'—' %><small>km/jam</small></strong><p><%= peak?'Terdata '+dateId(peak.work_date):'Belum ada speed valid pada periode ini' %></p><dl><div><dt>Rata-rata saat bergerak</dt><dd><%= hasSpeed?speedNumber(speedSummary.moving_average)+' km/jam':'Belum terdata' %></dd></div><div><dt>Rata-rata semua pembacaan</dt><dd><%= hasSpeed?speedNumber(speedSummary.average)+' km/jam':'Belum terdata' %></dd></div><div><dt>Periode rekap</dt><dd><%= speedFilters.from?dateId(speedFilters.from,true):'Awal data' %> – <%= speedFilters.to?dateId(speedFilters.to,true):'Akhir data' %></dd></div></dl><p class="unit-model-note">Top speed adalah nilai tertinggi pada filter ini. Gerak DT merupakan ilustrasi rekap, bukan GPS langsung.</p></aside></div>
</section>
